flowchart LR
    U[User in browser<br/>chat + song cards] -->|POST /api/chat| API[FastAPI server.py]
    API --> P[nl_parser<br/>text to profile]
    P <-->|structured output| LLM[(Gemini via llm.py<br/>or Claude)]
    P -->|profile, or keyword fallback| S[Deterministic scorer<br/>recommender.py]
    D[(songs.csv)] --> S
    S -->|top-k songs| R[rag.py retriever<br/>TF-IDF over song cards,<br/>genre and mood notes]
    K[(data/knowledge)] --> R
    R -->|retrieved context| E[explainer<br/>grounded + cited]
    E <-->|generate| LLM
    E -->|invalid citations or API error| F[Rule-based fallback]
    E --> API
    F --> API
    API -->|songs, reply, sources| U
